  "question": {
    "text": "The relation <math><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is defined in the set <math><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> as <math><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then&nbsp;",
